     1,
     "Dear all,<div><br></div><div>I am a bit new to latent factor analysis and to lavaan package in general.</div><div><br></div><div>I was just wondering whether lavaan package can be used to model non-linear factor analysis?</div><div><br></div><div>For instance, I would like to test this kind of model:</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-style:italic;white-space:pre-wrap\">G</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">[</span><span style=\"font-style:italic;white-space:pre-wrap\">x</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">]</span><span style=\"font-style:italic;white-space:pre-wrap\">n</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> = υ[</span><span style=\"font-style:italic;white-space:pre-wrap\">x</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">] + λ</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">1</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">[</span><span style=\"font-style:italic;white-space:pre-wrap\">x</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">] · </span><span style=\"font-style:italic;white-space:pre-wrap\">gn</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> + λ</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">2</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">[</span><span style=\"font-style:italic;white-space:pre-wrap\">x</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">] · </span><span style=\"font-style:italic;white-space:pre-wrap\">gn</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">2</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> + λ</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">3</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">[</span><span style=\"font-style:italic;white-space:pre-wrap\">x</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">] · gn2 · VP + </span><span style=\"font-style:italic;white-space:pre-wrap\">u</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">[</span><span style=\"font-style:italic;white-space:pre-wrap\">x</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">]</span><span style=\"font-style:italic;white-space:pre-wrap\">n </span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-style:italic;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Any help would be appreciated.</span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Best,</span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Sara</span></div>"
    ]
